# Calculator canon register (CALCULATOR-CANON.md) — these files must stay
# byte-identical with the sister repo (smarterwaywealth.com,
# D:\smarter-way-wealth). A CRLF/LF mismatch changes the SHA-256 hash even
# when the text content is identical, which is exactly what happened
# mid-task on this machine (core.autocrlf=true rewrote a stash/pop round
# trip to CRLF). Force LF on checkout AND commit for these four paths so
# git.autocrlf can never reintroduce that drift again — the sister repo
# needs the equivalent rule (its checkout is CRLF-autocrlf too).
#
# Note: the review that requested this rule named CalculationDetailsPanel.tsx
# as the fourth path; that file isn't part of this repo's register (see
# CALCULATOR-CANON.md's "Narrowed scope" — this repo has its own inline
# "View calculation details" experience instead) and doesn't exist here.
# shareSummary.ts is this repo's actual fourth register entry, substituted
# below.
src/components/Quiz.tsx text eol=lf
src/components/calculator/ShareMyResults.tsx text eol=lf
src/components/calculator/SocialShareRow.tsx text eol=lf
src/lib/shareSummary.ts text eol=lf
